## Original Content
How five ETFs will shape the savings of 7 million children

## Summary
A new proposal could restrict the investment options available within 'Trump Accounts,' a savings program for children. Under the proposal, five specific ETFs would shape how the savings of approximately 7 million children are managed.

## Key Points
- A new proposal could limit the investment options available within Trump Accounts
- Five ETFs would be central to determining how children's savings are invested
- Approximately 7 million children are expected to be affected by this savings program


